# playpick cell: mode=clear spec=shaman:elemental style=good size=25
# difficulty=heroic view=844x390,touch save=carried (behaves as fresh, #273).
# carried/fresh only opens Bonegrinder 10-normal by default, so #b=marrow&s=25&h=1
# unlocks the whole Bonegrinder chain (a kill's-worth of prefix, docs/progress.ts)
# before backing out to a real RAID->WALK IN at the door, rather than landing
# on the invite's own "visiting" single-fight framing (visiting=true skips the
# door and starts one pull directly, per src/main.ts:2136 & atTheDoor()).
# This is the first mode=clear/walk session in this job's history to actually
# reach 25-heroic rather than falling back to 10-normal (#273 means a `carried`
# save behaves as fresh, and no prior clear/walk session worked around that).
open #b=marrow&s=25&h=1
tap back
tap raid
tap next
tap class:shaman:elemental
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
evening good 130 4
state
shot end
